{"id":"ae206ab556213266","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-soundness-truth-equivalence.md","title":"充分真理谓词表达算术可靠性","display":"prop-soundness-truth-equivalence — 充分真理谓词表达算术可靠性","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-soundness-truth-equivalence","aliases":["91-prop-soundness-truth-equivalence","91-prop-soundness-from-truth","91-prop-reflection-from-soundness"],"display":"prop-soundness-truth-equivalence — 充分真理谓词表达算术可靠性","depends_on":["[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]","[[91-df-truth-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-soundness-truth-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-soundness-truth-equivalence</span><span>91-prop-soundness-from-truth</span><span>91-prop-reflection-from-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-soundness-truth-equivalence — 充分真理谓词表达算术可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"acda8ebf92673c3d\" href=\"?note=acda8ebf92673c3d\" title=\"91-df-soundness-predicate\">91-df-soundness-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> (标准自然数模型)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\)</span> (算术句编码谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\)</span> (PA 可证性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (标准真算术句的编码集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adeq}_{\\mathbb N}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n(\\mathbb N\\models T(\\overline n)\n\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\operatorname{Adeq}_{\\mathbb N}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n(\\mathbb N\\models T(\\overline n)\n\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}truth\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Adeq}_{\\mathbb N}(T)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N\\models\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\n\\to\nT(x)\n\\bigr)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}truth\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Adeq}_{\\mathbb N}(T)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N\\models\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\n\\to\nT(x)\n\\bigr)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>充分性前提不可省略。任意新增的一元谓词都可命名为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，但若它没有在\n标准模型中正确刻画算术真理，右侧全局反思句就不表达 PA 可靠性。</p>\n<p>这是外部标准模型中的等价。某个具体真理理论能否在内部证明相应全局\n反思，是更强的证明论问题；模式、统一公式与对编码量化的单句也必须\n分别处理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-soundness-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"acda8ebf92673c3d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adeq}_{\\mathbb N}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n(\\mathbb N\\models T(\\overline n)\n\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}truth\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Adeq}_{\\mathbb N}(T)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N\\models\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\n\\to\nT(x)\n\\bigr)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1786,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["acda8ebf92673c3d","0838e653809dc677"]}